  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734412",
      "title": "Building the Code For Production",
      "sourceHash": "69b17b1af2436062a24f09ed7b1e0491e770db86d28070f0351b289405b191d7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.17,
          "en": "Now that we learned about lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.17,
          "end": 5.82,
          "en": "and we optimized our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.82,
          "end": 8.91,
          "en": "Therefore we can move forward towards deploying this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.91,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "and we can start building our app for production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 13.89,
          "en": "That's the next step we should perform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.89,
          "end": 17.193,
          "en": "before we finally upload the production code to a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "Now, this build step here is required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "because the application we're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 25.62,
          "en": "is not the application we're going to upload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.62,
          "end": 26.76,
          "en": "at least not like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.76,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "This is not the code we're going to upload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "This is the code which we use during development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "It's very readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 35.76,
          "en": "and it sometimes even uses features which aren't supported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.76,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "like that in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 39.99,
          "en": "Like this JSX code that's not supported in browsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.99,
          "end": 42.66,
          "en": "It must be transformed before we can upload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.66,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "this on a server that serves it to end users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.09,
          "en": "By the way, here during development",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.09,
          "end": 49.62,
          "en": "when we preview this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.62,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "we also get a transformed version of that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 55.29,
          "en": "This development server, which we started with NPM start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.29,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "is transforming the code as we're writing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 60.873,
          "en": "So it's a life transformation process, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.04,
          "end": 65.01,
          "en": "Now, for uploading the code, we also wanna optimize it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.01,
          "end": 67.74,
          "en": "and we do this by quitting the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 69.6,
          "en": "and executing a different script.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.6,
          "end": 71.28,
          "en": "Here in this default project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 71.28,
          "end": 74.973,
          "en": "which we get from create React app, it's this build script.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "When we run NPM run build, we execute that script.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 82.2,
          "en": "And under the hood, this will produce a code bundle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "with highly optimized and transformed code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 87.243,
          "en": "which is ready to be uploaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 91.11,
          "en": "So here, I'll execute this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "As you see, this now creates an optimized production build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 99.63,
          "en": "And once it finished, it created that build folder here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.63,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "And it's the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 103.923,
          "en": "of that build folder that should be deployed to a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "In there in that static folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 109.53,
          "en": "you have your optimized JavaScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "with those different dynamically loaded junks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "for the lazy loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 117.36,
          "en": "but also with that main chunk that's downloaded initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.36,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "And that file contains all the code you wrote",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 122.82,
          "en": "plus all the third party package code you're using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 125.4,
          "en": "including the React library itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.4,
          "end": 126.96,
          "en": "It's of course not very readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.96,
          "end": 129.663,
          "en": "but it's a valid code that can be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.74,
          "end": 132.6,
          "en": "So it's the content of the build folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.6,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "that now must be uploaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.05,
          "en": "And that is indeed the next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 136.05,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "because in the next step we will now upload that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 140.583,
          "en": "and deploy it as website.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
